{
 "name": "steward-upgrade",
 "title": "workstation-steward: a safe upgrade, and its undo",
 "desc": "An illustrative steward sc upgrade, looping. The plan takes gh 2.103.2 and holds a two-day-old python release; after a yes it backs up the mise config, upgrades gh without pruning the old version, verifies every tool and records a receipt. Then steward sc rollback restores the backed-up config after another yes.",
